From 3284850b42f94934dfe6909ed6f1c4c145a7f69c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: yangsonglin13 <yangsonglin566@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 17 Sep 2026 12:01:20 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(rfork): stabilize seed transfer across instances

Allow an optional rank-offset seed server port while preserving dynamic port assignment and validating the configured base port.

Keep scheduler-sized topk index scratch buffers local to each instance so seeds remain compatible across different batching limits. Extend regression coverage for both raw and processed tensor layouts.

Signed-off-by: yangsonglin13 <yangsonglin566@gmail.com>
---
